"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, open 'APDoomLauncher.exe'. On the game dropdown, select 'DOOM II'.\n\nIn the 'Server' field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new room.\n\nIn 'Slot Name', enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nThe 'Password' field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nFinally, click 'Launch Game' and then, you can start playing!",
